<title>USA: IMC Global to buy back up to 5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>IMC Global to buy back up to 5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMC Global Inc said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to five million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will make the repurchases from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>The company said it has 96.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
